Z||000000||Taijiguy||08-09-2000||07:25 PM||||Hey, never miss an opportunity I say. <BR>I know there must be people on here who have businesses, or work for businesses where training is needed or needs improvement.<BR>I can develop a training program for you (or your company) improve an existing program, or anything in between. I also compose technical documentation. Pretty much anything to do with training and development.<BR>Just for reference, my current project is writing self study guides for American Electric Power Company, and Ohio State University. (not bad credentials I'd say) But the project will be over in September, so I need to start looking for some new projects.<BR>I'm also qualified in DACUM process for those who are familiar with it. If you aren't, you can find out about it here: <A HREF="http://www.interlynx.net/archway/ohio/DACUM.htm" TARGET=_blank> OSU DACUM PROCESS </A><BR>It's the OSU website, but I don't get work through them. They just have the official website<P>OK, I'm done now. If I can help anyone out, or anyone has any leads, let me know!<BR>Thanks,<P>-Taiji<P><p>[This message has been edited by Taijiguy (edited 08-09-2000).]||||reg||4
